+   `uuidInterfaces`, com `given soundnessUuid: (tactic: Tactic[Uuid.Error]) => ((Uuid is
+   Instantiable across Uuids from Text)^{tactic})`, espelhado em `soundness`. (#2089)

- ## iridescence
+ ## iridescence

